<title>JAPAN: Watanabe Gumi - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Watanabe Gumi - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 13.84		vs	   14.17</p>
<p> Operating   loss 135    million	  vs	prft 111 million</p>
<p> Current     loss 166    million	  vs	 prft 67 million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 220    million	  vs	 prft 21 million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 20.52 yen	  vs     prft 1.96 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     11 million	  vs	  11 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Watanabe Gumi Co Ltd is a contractor dealing mainly with road pavement work.</p>
